Back of the envelope estimation

population of world = 8 billion
people with smarthphones = 6 billion
music streaming users = 1 billion
spotify is one of the largest music streaming platforms
let's assume spotify has around 40-60% market share.
monthly users = 500 million
daily users are roughly half of monthly users = 250 million

3.1 -> monthly active users

(monthly active users)
startup : 10K - 1M users
growing product : 1M - 10 M users
Large national product : 10M -100M users
Global Internt service (Spotify , Netflix , Uber , Airbnb) : 100M - 1B users
Massive Platforms (Google Search , Youtube , Whatsapp) : 1B+ users

3.2 -> daily active users
most consumer apps have a DAU/MAU ratio somewhere between 30% - 60%.

3.3 -> peak concurrent users

3.4 -> average user activity

(for example:-) for spotify ,
monthly active users :- 600 million users
daily active users :- 40-50% -> 250 million users 
peak concurrent users :- not all dau listen to music simultaneously.
                         assume 2% of DAU are active at peak
                         250M * 2% = 5 million users
average user activity :- assume each active user listens to 20 songs/day
                      song streaming requests :- 250M * 20 = 5 billion / day
Requests per second :- (audio streaming) :- 5 billion / (86400) = 58,000 requests/second
peak traffic :- 3*the average = 260,000 RPS

spotify is predominantly a read-heavy system.
reads include :- stream song , fetch playlist , search , recommendations , browse albums.
writes include :- like a song , create playlist , follow artist , add/remove songs , listeneing history

assume out of 100 , 95 read , 5 write

metadata storage :-
assume spotify stores 150 million songs
each song metadata contains :- song title , artist , album , genre , duration , language
assume metadata size : 2 KB / song
total : 150M * 2 KB = 300 GB

Audio storage :-
average song : 4 minutes 
approximate size :- 10 MB / song
total storage :- 150M * 10MB = 1.5 PB

spotify sotres multiple audio qualities (96kbps, 160kbps,320kbps), so estimate:- 4-5 PB

Daily bandwidth :-
daily streams :- 5 billion
average song size :- 10 MB
bandwidth :- 5B * 10MB = 50 PB/day
most of this traffic is served through a CDN.

